        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Soften a Plate\n\nBlurs a clip so it can sit behind titles or a picture-in-picture inset without drawing the eye. It runs locally through ffmpeg with no API key or per-run cost.\n\n**How it works:** \"Clip\" takes your video. \"Soften\" applies a blur at strength 6, and \"Result\" returns the softened plate.\n\n**Try this:** Raise the strength on \"Soften\" to 12 when white title text still competes with detail in the background."
        },
